tion" target="_blank">GTA 5 TikFinity Plugin</a>, your viewers can trigger different actions in the game by sending gifts! <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UAo5xLcbF7g" target="_blank">Watch Tutorial</a>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n\n <div class="newsItem" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <img src="/img/minecraft_block.png" width="40" style="margin-right: 10px;">\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  You like to stream Minecraft? Our Minecraft integration offers your viewers an interactive experience. Your viewers can control Minecraft through gifts and other events! <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aj1nw7tMZ6M" target="_blank">Watch Tutorial</a>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n\n <div class="newsItem" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <img src="/img/button-press-1.png" width="40" style="margin-right: 10px;">\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  You want to allow your viewers to remotely control any Windows applications with gifts? Check out the new Keystroke Simulation feature available in Actions & Events! <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jm39IeQ6LfU" target="_blank">Watch Tutorial</a>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n\n <div class="newsItem" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <img src="/img/timer2.png" width="40" style="margin-right: 10px;">\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  You have a lot of time to stream? Great! Let your viewers decide how long you have to stream. Your viewers can extend a countdown with gifts! <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=363AX0F6VPY" target="_blank">Watch Tutorial</a>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n\n <div class="newsItem" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <img src="/img/streamerbot_logo.png" width="40" style="margin-right: 10px;">\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  Try our new <a href="https://streamer.bot/" target="_blank">Streamer.bot</a> integration to create even more interactive features and to connect other platforms. Read the <a hr