y:</b><br>\n  You can request a full refund of your last payment if you are not satisfied with TikFinity Pro.<br>\n  For features marked as "experimental" we recommend to request a trial version first before purchasing.<br>\n  Please keep in mind that we do not make automatic refunds in case of system failures.<br>\n  You have to request it. To request a trial or refund contact support.<br>\n  <i>Last update: 09/22/2024</i>\n  </div>\n </small>\n <div id="tazapayFlowContainer"></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection" id="patreonConnectionContainer">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Patreon Connection</h3>\n If you have an active subscription on <a href="https://www.patreon.com/zerody/membership" target="_blank">Patreon</a>, please connect your Patreon account to unlock TikFinity Pro!\n\n <div id="currentPatreonAccountInfo">\n <br>\n <small>Currently connected to <a href="" target="_blank"></a></small>\n </div>\n\n <br><br>\n <div id="connectPatreonButton"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <div class="setupConnected" id="setup-account">\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader" data-str="setup_account_head"></h3>\n <div data-str="setup_account_desc"></div><br>\n <div>\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td style="padding-right: 20px;">User-ID</td>\n  <td class="accountInfoUserId"></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td style="padding-right: 20px;">E-Mail</td>\n  <td class="accountInfoEmail"></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td style="padding-right: 20px;">Signup Date</td>\n  <td class="accountInfoSignupDate">12.25.2152</td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n <br>\n <div id="buttonLogout"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n\n <div class="showOnlyElectron">\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">TikTok Login</h3>\n <br>\n <div id="buttonTiktokLogin"></div>\n <div id="buttonTiktokLogout"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <div>\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection" id="setup-import-export-settings">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Import/Export Settings</h3>\n Here you can export your current profile settings to a file in order to share it<br>\n with other users or to import it into a different profile.\n <br><br>\n <div id="settingsExportButton"></div>\n <div id="settingsImportButton"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n \x3c!-- <div>\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Reset Settings</h3>\n Here you can reset (delete) your TikFinity settings of the current profile.\n <br><br>\n <div id="buttonResetSettings"></div>\n <div id="buttonResetImportedSettings"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n </div> --\x3e\n\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection" id="setup-advanced-settings">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Advanced Settings</h3>\n\n <div id="checkboxServerSideConnection"></div>\n <div id="checkboxShowTiktokPopup"></div>\n <div id="checkboxShowLocalizedGiftNames"></div>\n <div id="checkboxShowUserNicknames"></div>\n <div id="checkboxProcessOnlyFirstEmoteByActions"></div>\n <div id="checkboxQueueKeystrokes"></div>\n <br>\n\n <div class="dxForm">\n <div class="form">\n  <div class="dx-fieldset">\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  TikTok Language\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxWebcastLanguage"></div>\n  <small>Relevant for localized gifts. Requires a valid language-country code. Example: en-US</small>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <div class="showOnlyElectron">\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">API Connectivity</h3>\n\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n  <div>\n  If the connection to the TikFinity server is unstable and you receive<br>\n  a large number of API errors, you can switch to an alternative server.<br>\n  This creates an entry in your system\'s hosts file.\n  </div>\n\n  <br>\n\n  <div id="buttonSwitchServer"></div>\n  <div id="buttonRestoreServer"></div>\n\n  <br>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <br><br><br>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection" id="setup-debug-options">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Debug Options</h3>\n\n <table>\n <tr>\n  <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n  <div>\n  This function is used to identify errors.<br>\n  Activate it when prompted by the TikFinity Support Team!\n  </div>\n\n  <br>\n\n  <div id="buttonEnableDebug"></div>\n  <div id="buttonOpenTikTok"></div>\n\n  <br>\n  </td>\n  <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n  <pre id="browserBridgeDebug" style="margin-top: -30px; margin-left: 100px;"></pre>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n\n</div>\n<br><br><br>\n\n<div id="setupConditionalDbResetPopup"></div>'},{name:"chatbot",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<div class="desktopAppPromotion"></div>\n\n<h2 class="blueheading" data-str="chatbot_head"></h2>\n\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<div id="notificationChatbotNeedsApproval" class="hidden">\n <div id="chatbotNoticeBanners">\n <div class="notification redNotification" style="width: 900px; background-color: #570d1c;" data-str="chatbot_requirements"></div>\n <div class="notification redNotification" style="width: 900px; background-color: #570d1c;" data-str="chatbot_replacement"></div>\n <br>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id="chatbotWarning">\n <br>\n <div class="notification redNotification" style="width: 650px; background-color: #570d1c;">Please keep in mind that your account is used to send chatbot messages. Make sure that all messages comply with the TikTok rules, because you are responsible for them! If you have problems with the chatbot, take a look at our <a href="/chatbot-tr