ss="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdCoinDropEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_command_coindrop"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdCoinDrop"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton" data-destpage="coindrop"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection" style="width: 900px" id="chatcommands-custom">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader" data-str="chatcommands_custom_head"></h3>\n\n <div data-str="chatcommands_custom_desc"></div>\n\n <br><br>\n\n <div class="dxForm">\n <div class="form">\n <div class="dx-fieldset largeCommandDescriptionLabels">\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdCustomCommandsEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_custom_commands"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdCustomCommands"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdCustomSubCommandsEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_custom_sub_commands"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdCustomSubCommands"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">\n  <div id="checkboxChatCmdCustomUserCommandsEnabled" class="optionCheckbox"></div> <span data-str="chatcommands_custom_user_commands"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxChatCmdCustomUserCommands"></div>\n  <div class="gotoCommandSettingsButton"></div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div>'},{name:"tts",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<h2 class="blueheading">Text-to-Speech Chat</h2>\n\n<div class="localeSpecific localeSpecific_en">\n Here you can read out the chat comments from your viewers automatically via Text-to-Speech (TTS).<br>\n The voice is played directly in the browser. No Overlay is required!<br>\n A TTS feature is also available via <a onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'actionsandevents\')">Actions & Events</a> which offers more flexibility. (e.g. Read out gifts)\n</div>\n\n<div class="localeSpecific localeSpecific_de">\n Hier kannst du die Chat-Kommentare deiner Zuschauer automatisch über Text-to-Speech (TTS) vorlesen lassen.<br>\n Die Stimme wird direkt im Browser abgespielt. Es ist kein Overlay erforderlich!<br>\n Eine TTS-Funktion ist auch über <a onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'actionsandevents\')">Aktionen & Events</a> verfügbar, die mehr Flexibilität bietet. (z. B. Geschenke vorlesen)\n</div>\n\n<div class="localeSpecific localeSpecific_es">\n Aquí puedes leer los comentarios del chat de tus espectadores automáticamente mediante Texto a Voz (TTS).<br>\n La voz se reproduce directamente en el navegador. ¡No se requiere ningún overlay!<br>\n También hay una función TTS disponible a través de <a onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'actionsandevents\')">Acciones y Eventos</a> que ofrece más flexibilidad. (por ejemplo, leer regalos)\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<div id="ttsOverQuotaBanner" class="redNotification hidden" style="max-width: 1100px; cursor: pointer; background-color: #661525;" onclick="setup.scrollToPaymentUi(`TTS_DAILY_QUOTA`, true)">\n <div>\n <table>\n <tr>\n <td style="font-size: 2em; padding-right: 15px; color: #d43555;">\n  <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i>\n </td>\n <td>\n  The professional voices (marked with ⭐ and 🎵) are currently disabled for you because you have reached the daily limit of 100 uses.<br>\n  You can upgrade to <a onclick="setup.scrollToPaymentUi(`TTS_DAILY_QUOTA`, true);">TikFinity Pro</a> for unlimited use of all voices or switch back to the free "default voice".<br>\n  We hope for your understanding because the generation of the voices costs us additional server ressources.\n </td>\n </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<table id="ttsSettingsTable">\n <tr>\n <td>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="margin-right: 0px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">General Settings</h4>\n\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div><b>Enabled</b></div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="checkboxTtsEnabled"></div>\n  <div id="ttsStartHint" style="position: absolute; margin-top: -30px; margin-left: 30px; cursor: pointer;" onclick="$(\'#checkboxTtsEnabled\').click()">\n  <div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 1.5em">👈</div>\n  <div style="display: inline-block;"><b>Start here</b></div>\n  </div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Language</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="selectboxTtsLanguage"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Voice <small style="color: #fe2c55; position: absolute; margin-left: 6px;">NEW!</small></div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="selectboxTtsVoice"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr class="proVoiceSelectNote hidden">\n  <td>\n  <div></div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="voiceLimitNotice"><small style="width: 180px;display: block;margin-top: -15px;"></small></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Random Voice</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="checkboxTtsRandomVoiceV2"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Default Speed</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsDefaultSpeed"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Default Pitch</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsDefaultPitch"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Volume</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="slideTtsVolume"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </td>\n\n <td>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="margin-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Allowed Users</h4>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersNormal"></div><br><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersFollowers"></div><br><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersSubscribers"></div><br><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersModerators"></div><br><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersTeamMembers"></div><br><div onclick="tts.setMinimumMemberLevel()" style="font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: 5px;margin-left: 38px;color: #359bd4;cursor: pointer;"><i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Min. Level: <span id="ttsTeamMembersMinLevel">1</span></div><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersTopGifters"></div><br><div onclick="tts.setTopGiftersN()" style="font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: 5px;margin-left: 38px;color: #359bd4;cursor: pointer;"><i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Top: <span id="ttsTopGiftersTopN">3</span></div><br>\n <div id="checkboxTtsUsersSpecific"></div><br><div onclick="$(\'#ttsSpecialUserSection\').removeClass(\'shakeEffect\'); setTimeout(() => $(\'#ttsSpecialUserSection\').addClass(\'shakeEffect\'), 100)" style="font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: 5px;margin-left: 38px;color: #359bd4;cursor: pointer;"><i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Manage List</div><br>\n </div>\n </td>\n\n <td>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="margin-right: 0px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Comment Types</h4>\n <p>Read...</p>\n <div id="radiogroupTtsCommentTypes"></div>\n <table id="ttsCommentTypesCommandTable">\n  <tr>\n  <td>Command</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="textboxCommentTypesSpecialCommand"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </td>\n\n <td style="max-width: 330px;">\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="margin-right: 0px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Charge Points</h4>\n <div id="radiogroupTtsChargePoints"></div>\n\n <table>\n  <tr>\n  <td>\n  <div>Cost per Message</div>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsCost"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n\n <div id="ttsChargePointsWarning" style="color: #e97373;">The subtraction of points is only possible if you select the comment type option starting with "dot" or "slash"! Otherwise, viewers would lose points for each comment!</div>\n\n <small>(If the user doesn\'t have enough points, the comment will NOT be read)</small>\n </div>\n </td>\n </tr>\n</table>\n\n<table>\n <tr style="vertical-align: top;">\n <td>\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" id="ttsSpecialUserSection">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Special Users</h4>\n\n <div>\n  Here you can allow and disallow users to use TTS and assign their own voices!<br>\n  If you disable the "Allowed" option, the user is entirely blocked from TTS.<br>\n  Click on + to add a new user.\n </div>\n\n <br>\n <div id="ttsUserGrid"></div>\n </div>\n </td>\n\n <td style="padding-left: 30px;">\n <div id="ttsVoiceTesterArea" class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="height: 310px;">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Voice Tester</h4>\n\n <div id="textboxTtsTest"></div>\n <div id="buttonTtsTest" style="margin-top: -2px;"></div>\n\n <br><br>\n <h4 class="blueheading">TTS Logs</h4>\n <pre id="ttsLogs" style="position: absolute; max-width: 400px;">No Entries</pre>\n </div>\n </td>\n </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n<table>\n <tr>\n <td style="vertical-align: top;">\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Spam Protection</h4>\n <table id="ttsSpamProtectionTable">\n  <tr>\n  <td>User Cooldown (seconds)</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsUserCooldown"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>Max Queue Length</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsQueueLength"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>Max Comment Length</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="numberboxTtsCommentLength"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>Filter Letter Spam</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="checkboxTtsFilterLetterSpam"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>Filter @mentions</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="checkboxTtsFilterMentions"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td>Filter !commands</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="checkboxTtsFilterCommands"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </td>\n <td style="padding-left: 20px; vertical-align: top;">\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth">\n <h4 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Advanced</h4>\n <table id="ttsAdvancedTable">\n  <tr>\n  <td>Message Template</td>\n  <td>\n  <div id="textboxTtsMessageTemplate"></div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  <td></td>\n  <td>\n  <div style="font-size:0.8em;">\n  <b>Placeholder Params:</b> {nickname} {username} {comment}<br>\n  <b>Example:</b> {nickname} says {comment}\n  </div>\n  </td>\n  </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n </td>\n </tr>\n</table>\n\n<div id="numberInputDialog"></div>\n\n<br><br><br>'},{name:"actionsandevents",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<div class="desktopAppPromotion"></div>\n\n<h2 class="blueheading" data-str="actionsandevents_head"></h2>\n\n<div data-str="actionsandevents_desc"></div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div id="actionProExpiredWarning" class="redNotification hidden" style="background-color: #661525; cursor: pointer;" onclick="setup.scrollToPaymentUi(\'ACTIONS_DOWNGRADE\', true);">\n <div>\n <table>\n <tr>\n <td style="font-size: 2em; padding-right: 15px; color: #d43555;">\n  <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i>\n </td>\n <td>\n  Some actions are currently disabled because your <a onclick="setup.scrollToPaymentUi(\'ACTIONS_DOWNGRADE\', true);">TikFinity Pro</a> subscription has expired.<br>\n  To use more than 5 actions, please consider purchasing <a onclick="setup.scrollToPaymentUi(\'ACTIONS_DOWNGRADE\', true);">TikFinity Pro</a> again. \n </td>\n </tr>\n </table>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n\x3c!-- <div id="aaeLiveStudioNotification" class="redNotification actionsandeventsNotification actionsandeventsNotificationWithActions" style="paddin