\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field">\n  <div class="dx-field-label">Stream Key</div>\n  <div class="dx-field-value">\n  <div id="textboxRtmpgenKey"></div>\n  <dib id="buttonRtmpgenCopyKey"></dib>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <br>\n <div id="rtmpgenKeyKeyButton"></div>\n <br><br>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth">\n <div style="width: 650px;">\n <b>Requirements</b>\n <ul>\n <li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/studio/download" target="_blank">TikTok Live Studio</a> must be installed on this computer.</li>\n <li>Your TokTok Account needs access to streaming via TikTok Live Studio.</li>\n </ul>\n <b>Instructions</b>\n <ol>\n <li>Start your stream in Live Studio (Landscape or Portrait mode).</li>\n <li>Configure OBS to use the same resolution, bitrate and FPS.</li>\n <li>Click the <b>Generate Key</b> button and confirm all prompts.</li>\n <li>Copy the Server and Stream Key to OBS (Settings > Stream > Service: Custom)</li>\n <li>Start streaming from OBS.</li>\n </ol>\n <b>Good to know</b>\n <ul>\n <li>Live Studio Compatibility mode is not supported when streaming from OBS.</li>\n <li>After key generation you have about 2 minutes to enter the key in OBS and start the stream. Meanwhile, your viewers will see an unstable connection warning.</li>\n <li>The generated Server and Key is only valid for a single stream.</li>\n <li>For a new stream you need to generate new data.</li>\n <li>Never share the key with anyone else!</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n</div>'},{name:"timer",hasHtml:!0,hasJs:!0,hasCss:!0,template:'<div class="desktopAppPromotion"></div>\n\n<h2 class="blueheading">Timer</h2>\n<div>\n Here you can create a countdown that can be controlled by your viewers.<br>\n Viewers can extend or shorten the countdown through interactions to decide how long you have to stream.<br>\n Watch <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=363AX0F6VPY" target="_blank">this tutorial</a> to learn how to set up a subathon timer.<br>\n</div>\n<br>\n\n<div class="setupUnconnected">\n <div class="redNotification" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="navigation.pageChange(\'setup\')">\n <div class="error" data-str="start_setup_required"></div>\n </div>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" id="timer-overlay">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Overlay</h3>\n\n <div class="timerpageoverlays" data-widgetid="timer"></div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="min-width: 869px;" id="timer-control">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Control</h3>\n <table>\n <tr>\n <td>\n <div id="buttonTimerStart"></div>\n </td>\n <td>\n <div id="buttonTimerPause"></div>\n </td>\n <td>\n <div id="buttonTimerReset"></div>\n </td>\n\n <td>\n\n </td>\n <td>\n <div id="numberboxTimerAddManual"></div>\n </td>\n <td>\n <div id="buttonTimerIncreaseManual"></div>\n </td>\n <td>\n <div id="buttonTimerDecreaseManual"></div>\n </td>\n </tr>\n </table>\n <br>\n</div>\n\n\n<table>\n <tr>\n <td>\n\n <div class="greyBackgroundSection greyBackgroundSectionDynamicWidth" style="height: 700px;" id="timer-settings">\n <h3 class="blueheading noTopMarginHeader">Settings</h3>\n\n <div>\n  <div class="dxForm">\n  <div class="form">\n  <div class="dx-fieldset">\n  <div class="dx-field">\n   <div class="dx-field-label">Default Start Value</div>\n   <div class="dx-field-value">\n   <div id="numberboxTimerStartValue"></div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class="dx-field">\n   <div class="dx-field-label">Action on expiry</div>\n   <div class="dx-field-value dxFieldValueFix">\n   <b class="timerExpireActionName">-</b> <a class="changeactionlabel" onclick="timer.changeExpireAction()" data-str="misc_change"></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n\n <br>\n\n <div>\n  Define by how many seconds the timer increases or decreases for each interaction type.<br>\n  Use positive values to increase the t